{
  "scene_id": "scene01_intellectual_wall",
  "video_title": "What Is Machine Learning?",
  "scene_title": "The Intellectual Wall",
  "order": 1,
  "duration_mode": "audio_driven",
  "voice": {
    "language": "en-IN",
    "speaker": "priya",
    "model": "bulbul:v3"
  },
  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "n1a",
      "text": "For a long time, the way humans worked with computers was simple:"
    },
    {
      "id": "n1b",
      "text": "we wrote the rules, and the computer followed them."
    },
    {
      "id": "n2a",
      "text": "That is traditional programming."
    },
    {
      "id": "n2b",
      "text": "You tell the machine exactly what to do."
    },
    {
      "id": "n2c",
      "text": "If this happens, do that."
    },
    {
      "id": "n2d",
      "text": "If this condition is true, take this action."
    },
    {
      "id": "n2e",
      "text": "It is clear, precise, and very powerful."
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "text": "But it also has a limit."
    },
    {
      "id": "n4a",
      "text": "This approach assumes we already know the full rulebook."
    },
    {
      "id": "n4b",
      "text": "It assumes we can describe every case ahead of time."
    },
    {
      "id": "n4c",
      "text": "And for many real problems, that is not possible."
    },
    {
      "id": "n5a",
      "text": "Take a simple example: recognizing a square in an image."
    },
    {
      "id": "n5b",
      "text": "At first, the rules seem easy."
    },
    {
      "id": "n5c",
      "text": "Four sides, equal length, right angles."
    },
    {
      "id": "n5d",
      "text": "But then the real world gets involved."
    },
    {
      "id": "n5e",
      "text": "The square is rotated."
    },
    {
      "id": "n5f",
      "text": "The image is blurred."
    },
    {
      "id": "n5g",
      "text": "The edges are uneven."
    },
    {
      "id": "n5h",
      "text": "The lighting is bad."
    },
    {
      "id": "n5i",
      "text": "Suddenly, the rule set grows and grows."
    },
    {
      "id": "n6a",
      "text": "And this is the real problem."
    },
    {
      "id": "n6b",
      "text": "The difficulty is not just computation."
    },
    {
      "id": "n6c",
      "text": "It is description."
    },
    {
      "id": "n7a",
      "text": "We can build rules for clean, simple cases."
    },
    {
      "id": "n7b",
      "text": "But once the problem becomes messy,"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7c",
      "text": "the rules become too large,"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7d",
      "text": "too fragile,"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7e",
      "text": "and too hard to maintain."
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "text": "That is where machine learning begins."
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "text": "Instead of asking humans to write every rule by hand, we let the system learn patterns from data."
    }
  ],
